  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adolescent Girls Empowerment Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve sexual and reproductive health for poor and vulnerable adolescent girls in ZambiaTo improve gender equality by providing adolescent girls with social, financial and sexual and reproductive health knowledge and skills.  This will contribute towards MDG 3 and will result in 10,000 girls being empowered in rural and urban Zambia by 2017</narrative>
  </description>
